OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARussell Brand accusers 'haunted' for
OL,4,Ayears by alleged crimes, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrand, 51, is on trial facing seven
OL,7,Fcharges; three counts of rape, three
OL,8,Fcharges of sexual assault and one
OL,9,Fallegation of attempted indecent
OL,10,Fassault. He denies the charges.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
